>> title: Summer Tomato Panzanella
>> servings: 4
>> tags: main, salad, vegetarian
>> time: 25 minutes

Tear @sourdough bread{300%g} into chunks, toss with @olive oil{3%tbsp} and crisp in the #oven{} at 200C for ~{10%minutes}.

Cut @tomato{800%g} into wedges, salt them with @salt{1%tsp} and leave to weep in a #bowl{} for ~{10%minutes}.

Slice @cucumber{1} and @red onion{1} thinly, and soak the onion in @red wine vinegar{2%tbsp}.

Toss everything with @basil{1%handful}, the tomato juices and a last @olive oil{2%tbsp}.
